        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Complex Analysis - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Multiplication in polar form:\n  z₁z₂ = r₁r₂ · e^(i(θ₁+θ₂))   — magnitudes multiply, angles add"
    },
    {
      "id": "14-COMPLEX-ANALYSIS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "14-COMPLEX-ANALYSIS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
