        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Complex Analysis - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "De Moivre's theorem:  zⁿ = rⁿ e^(inθ)  →  (cos θ + i sin θ)ⁿ = cos nθ + i sin nθ"
    },
    {
