        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Complex Analysis - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Under this identification, Möbius transformations (see below) become exactly\nthe rotations/reflections of the Riemann sphere — a beautiful geometric fact."
    }
